<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Stage 3 — Before payment</span>
<h1>The carton is part of the product</h1>
<p class="lead">For parcel-shipped furniture, the box matters as much as the piece inside. We drop-test, review packaging specs and validate hardware kits so your returns rate stops eating the margin.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">What we validate</span></div></div><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>ISTA 3A drop sequence</h3><p>Sampled cartons through the parcel-network drop protocol—six orientations, photographed results.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/#book"><h3>Packaging spec review</h3><p>Corner protection, honeycomb board, void fill and carton grade vs the weight actually inside.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/#book"><h3>Flat-pack kit integrity</h3><p>Hardware BOM counts, instruction sheets, part labelling—the difference between a sale and a return.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/#book"><h3>Marketplace requirements</h3><p>Packaging expectations for Amazon-class parcel networks checked before goods are sealed.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Why it pays for itself</span><p class="prose rv">Transit damage is the silent margin killer for e-commerce furniture: the product was perfect, the journey wasn't. A failed drop test before shipment costs a packaging respec; a failed journey after shipment costs return freight, refunds and reviews. Buyers typically add this to a pre-shipment inspection on the same visit—one booking, both risks covered.</p></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Book</span>
<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
